// دالة رسم الشارت المطورة لحل مشكلة نقطة البداية وتحديث المحور اليمين ديناميكياً
function renderPerformanceChart(containerId = 'performanceChart') {
  const container = $(containerId);
  if(!container) return;

  const chartType = $('chartTypeSelect') ? $('chartTypeSelect').value : 'r';
  const rrFilter = $('rrFilterSelect') ? $('rrFilterSelect').value : 'all';

  let sortedTrades = [...data.trades].sort((a, b) => new Date(a.date || 0) - new Date(b.date || 0));

  if(rrFilter === 'weekly') {
    const oneWeekAgo = new Date();
    oneWeekAgo.setDate(oneWeekAgo.getDate() - 7);
    sortedTrades = sortedTrades.filter(t => new Date(t.date || 0) >= oneWeekAgo);
  } else if(rrFilter === 'monthly') {
    const oneMonthAgo = new Date();
    oneMonthAgo.setMonth(oneMonthAgo.getMonth() - 1);
    sortedTrades = sortedTrades.filter(t => new Date(t.date || 0) >= oneMonthAgo);
  }

  let cumulative = 0;
  const points = [{ xLabel: 'Start', value: 0, date: '' }];

  sortedTrades.forEach(t => {
    let val = chartType === 'pnl' ? (Number(t.pnl) || 0) : (Number(t.r) || 0);
    cumulative += val;
    points.push({
      xLabel: t.date ? t.date.slice(5) : '',
      value: cumulative,
      date: t.date || ''
    });
  });

  if(points.length === 1) {
    container.innerHTML = `<div class="empty" style="padding-top:80px; text-align:center; color:var(--muted);">No performance data available for chart yet.</div>`;
    return;
  }

  const values = points.map(p => p.value);
  let maxVal = Math.max(...values, 0);
  let minVal = Math.min(...values, 0);

  if(maxVal === minVal) {
    maxVal += 1;
    minVal -= 1;
  }

  const paddingRange = (maxVal - minVal) * 0.15;
  maxVal += paddingRange;
  minVal -= paddingRange;

  const width = container.clientWidth || 500;
  const height = container.clientHeight || 280;
  const margin = { top: 20, right: 65, bottom: 30, left: 20 };
  const graphWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;
  const graphHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;

  const getX = (i) => margin.left + (i / (points.length - 1)) * graphWidth;
  const getY = (val) => margin.top + graphHeight - ((val - minVal) / (maxVal - minVal || 1)) * graphHeight;

  const pathCoords = points.map((p, i) => `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${getX(i)} ${getY(p.value)}`).join(' ');
  const firstX = getX(0);
  const lastX = getX(points.length - 1);
  const bottomY = margin.top + graphHeight;
  const areaCoords = `${pathCoords} L ${lastX} ${bottomY} L ${firstX} ${bottomY} Z`;

  const steps = 5;
  let yAxisGridHTML = '';
  let yAxisLabelsHTML = '';

  for(let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {
    const val = minVal + (maxVal - minVal) * (i / steps);
    const yPos = getY(val);
    yAxisGridHTML += `<line x1="${margin.left}" y1="${yPos}" x2="${width - margin.right}" y2="${yPos}" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.6"/>`;
    
    let formattedVal = chartType === 'pnl' ? (val >= 0 ? `+$${val.toFixed(0)}` : `-$${Math.abs(val).toFixed(0)}`) : (val >= 0 ? `+${val.toFixed(1)}R` : `${val.toFixed(1)}R`);
    yAxisLabelsHTML += `<text x="${width - margin.right + 8}" y="${yPos + 4}" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">${formattedVal}</text>`;
  }

  const lastPoint = points[points.length - 1];
  const lastXPos = getX(points.length - 1);
  const lastYPos = getY(lastPoint.value);
  const startPoint = points[0];
  const startXPos = getX(0);
  const startYPos = getY(startPoint.value);

  container.innerHTML = `
    <svg viewBox="0 0 ${width} ${height}">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="chartGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--green)" stop-opacity="0.3"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--green)" stop-opacity="0.0"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      ${yAxisGridHTML}
      <path d="${areaCoords}" fill="url(#chartGrad)"/>
      <path d="${pathCoords}" fill="none" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2.5"/>
      ${yAxisLabelsHTML}
      <circle cx="${startXPos}" cy="${startYPos}" r="4" fill="var(--green)"/>
      <text x="${startXPos}" y="${bottomY + 16}" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">${startPoint.xLabel || 'Start'}</text>
      <circle cx="${lastXPos}" cy="${lastYPos}" r="4" fill="var(--green)"/>
      <text x="${lastXPos}" y="${bottomY + 16}" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10" text-anchor="end">${lastPoint.xLabel}</text>
    </svg>
  `;
}

function renderAll(){
  renderMetrics();
  renderStats();
  renderPerformanceChart();
  renderCalendar();
  renderTrades();
  renderAnalytics();
  renderNotes();
  renderStrategiesManager();
  renderDropdowns();
}

// Initial Run
changeTheme(data.theme || 'dark');
$('themeSelect').value = data.theme || 'dark';
renderAll();
</script>
</body>
</html>
